<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - March 17.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - March 17.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the close of trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close was 3798.12, 52.81 points or 1.41 percent higher than Friday's close.</p>
